==Battleground==
*1 [[Sir Seal]] spawns after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>.
*10 [[Assassin Bear]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 20~26.67 seconds<sup>600f~800f</sup>.
*2 [[Mega Baa Baa]]s spawn after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>, delay 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>.
*2 [[Condemned Peng]]s spawn after 86.67 seconds<sup>2,600f</sup>, delay 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>.
*1 [[Maawth]] spawns after 133.33 seconds<sup>4,000f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 75% HP:
**1 [[Assassin Bear]] spawns.

==Strategy==
Assassin Bear's spawn rate is rather high, meaning you're going to have to get creative for solutions.
[[Stone Cat (Rare Cat)|Boulder Cat]], [[Glass Cat (Rare Cat)|Macho Crystal Cat]] and [[Elder Mask Doron (Special Cat)|Awakened Doron]] are great choices for the Assassin Bears. Don't fight too close to the enemy base, as an Assassin Bear may hide behind a peon, causing the Boulder Cat to be unable to reach him.

As for the rest of the stage, the support is pretty minimal. Just deploy your usual [[:Category:Super Rare Cats|Super Rares]] and [[:Category:Mythic Cats|Mythics]] to knock them out.

